@startuml j5-no-key-run
!include style.iuml
title J5 No-key run and model failures
actor Patient
participant "Chat page\n(index.html, chat.js)" as Chat
participant "core.js" as Core
database "localStorage" as LS
participant "api/chat\n(Vercel)" as API
participant "OpenRouter\n(DeepSeek)" as OR
autonumber

Patient -> Chat : sends a question the file can answer
Chat -> Core : FD.answer(q, data)
Core --> Chat : kind "answer", modelOk true, text, facts
Chat -> API : POST /api/chat {draft, facts, lang, clinic} (6 s limit in the browser)
alt OPENROUTER_API_KEY is not set
  API --> Chat : 503 {error: "no key"}
else bad body or no draft
  API --> Chat : 400 {error: "bad request" or "missing draft"}
else OpenRouter answers with an error status
  API -> OR : chat/completions
  OR --> API : error
  API --> Chat : 502 {error: "model <status>"}
else empty text, or cut off (finish_reason "length")
  API -> OR : chat/completions
  OR --> API : no usable text
  API --> Chat : 502 {error: "empty" or "cut off"}
else OpenRouter takes more than 5 s
  API -> OR : chat/completions
  API -> API : AbortController stops the call
  API --> Chat : 504 {error: "timeout"}
else the whole call takes more than 6 s, or the network fails
  Chat -> Chat : AbortController aborts; catch gives null
else 200 with text
  API --> Chat : 200 {text}
  Chat -> Core : FD.guard(text, ruled, data)
  Core --> Chat : false (rejected)
  note right of Core
  Rejected when: empty or over 900 characters; a number
  not in the draft or the file; a capitalised name not in
  them; a risky word (ticket, discount, free, refund...)
  the draft did not use; a medicine; an unknown doctor;
  a fact from the draft missing; the wrong script.
  end note
end
note over Chat : askModel() resolves to null in every case above
Chat -> Core : FD.addTicket({reply: ruled.text, source: "file", ...})
Core -> LS : write frontdesk.tickets
Chat --> Patient : the rules engine's answer with "Answered from the clinic file"
note right of Chat : same facts and wording as a run with the key; only the model's rewording is missing
@enduml
